<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Nafin July interest rate 23.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Nafin July interest rate 23.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican state development bank Nacional Financiera (Nafin) said on Thursday its so-called &quot;Tasa Nafin&quot; interest rate for July was set at 23.00 percent.</p>
<p>The rate fell 86 basis points from June's 23.86 percent.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9549))</p>
</text>
